[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238704\">7015A06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3239058\">7210G76</a></p><p>1. Undo retainer (1a) and move the rear washer jet (1b) slightly\nto one side.</p><p>2. Disconnect the pipe.</p><p>3. Recover the rear washer jet.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019572.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the rear washer jet is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the pipe to the rear washer jet.</p><p>Position the rear washer jet and do up\nthe clip.</p><p>1. Adjust the jet position with the aid of a pin inserted in the\nhole.</p><p>Test the operation of the rear washer jet.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019573.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p><a href=\"#/3239058\">7210G76</a></p><p>Check the operation of the third brake\nlight.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238704\">7015A06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p>"]]